      "content": "hey so i’ve been reading a lot about biohacking my energy levels since im constantly wiped out. i think my iron is low so i'm planning on starting a high-dose regimen to fix it fast. i was thinking of doing 300mg of ferrous sulfate every morning to really jumpstart my levels. does that sound like a solid way to optimize my energy so i can stop feeling so drained?",
